。对于商家来说，面对生产、销售趋向________，市场竞争日益激烈，与其花费大量时间精力提升产品质量，不如在包装上下功夫来得\"性价比高\"。依次填入画横线部分最恰当的一项是：","options":[{"key":"A","text":"精美绝伦  大众化"},{"key":"B","text":"华而不实  同质化"},{"key":"C","text":"美轮美奂  标准化"},{"key":"D","text":"表里不一  个性化"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"第一空：华而不实，侧重不实用，符合文意。精美绝伦、美轮美奂为褒义词，与作者感情色彩不符。表里不一，外表和内在不一致，侧重的是不一样，横线上修饰的是礼盒的外包装本身，而不是强调礼盒外表和里面装的东西不一致。第二空：同质化，符合市场竞争语境。","originalExampleFingerprint":"2a338bb7","declaredOriginalSource":"2022上事业编联考","answerSourceKeys":["[\"verbal\",\"word-discrimination\",\"example\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-c02-verbal-application-02","questionRevision":2,"effectiveContentDigest":"f1d9a34f5cc44a62698316cd6956a062719cef9a5e72a658453a0620b12a18d2"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-v4-verbal-packaging-context","revision":1,"sha256":"f18acb65d08336543cd2e4412dc60b0a8b209346db82124cd093a3cdb1472cdb"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"word-discrimination","tabId":"example","revision":null,"sha256":"243cda0d57d8344446404c207dd988a81783e45ada7d91867339b01696349d70"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"word-discrimination","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"33ee936abb1f38b8d7b50467be411f1c81dd02cd794c9b7eb1cd55b151b99d22"}],"sourceAnchors":[],"originalExample":{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"word-discrimination","tabId":"example","expectedBlockSha256":"2c6753abdf241a4a494840f2afc33166267f3b2c3ea49dd275036fbe915e2b2b","revision":null},"materialGroup":null,"images":[],"sharedSourceBindings":[]},"dependencyDigest":"ef706e770d777ca1d3faebbafa807379cc3acd5c04f98d75935b9eb9b34a3f0e","ruleVersion":"exam-goal-v4","ruleDigest":"cde4b0cf5c8f1542a5a662cc642037c39b9968aba1618b319d56fd8b62cb8033","receiptId":"codex-v4-ev3-prior-content-review-notes-q-c02-verbal-application-02-r2","signatureVersion":"notes-semantic-v1","signature":"9c90cf21263372ed3f33668dedc269c7fa28ee3d3889cf29f1a4b685e883